{"method": "item/completed", "params": {"threadId": "01a0b72b-1ec4-7e20-9dec-df0f58fc1c37", "turnId": "01a0b73a-6214-7692-bb77-11b9bbec20f2", "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "msg_0300a912ecad84fb016aade24a786c87d1849ed140bb27d71f", "text": "On Wednesday morning, you find Nell in the office updating the staff rota.\n\n“What should I take next in the archive, and are there any practical changes I need to know about?”\n\n“I’ve checked yesterday’s records. Finish the programme box you started, then take the next one on the shelf—the run from 1986 to 1988. Keep those at box level for now. I don’t need a separate entry for every duplicate.”\n\nShe returns the unsigned collection list from the yellow tray to its transfer file, with its status still marked as unconfirmed.\n\n“Dev confirmed the auditorium before yesterday’s deadline. He and Hana completed the receiver test last night, so that booking is finished.”\n\nNell makes one alteration to the rota in ink.\n\n“Owen’s inland appointment is definite now. He sent the shift change last night, and I’ve confirmed him for Friday instead of tomorrow.”\n\nShe closes the rota and gives you the reference sheet for the next programme box.", "phase": "final_answer"}}}
